      "text": "Rudolph. The old lock still opens to the name of the wizard who built this place: KHAZAN. I found it under the moss in an hour. Your new ward opens to nothing, and it bites me. It bites only me. You keyed it to me. I am sitting on your doorstep until you come out and explain that to my face. E."
